The following are strictly prohibited:

- Distributing this software outside the institution's authorized channels.
- Modifying, altering or creating derivative works without the express written permission of the development team.
- Using the software in contexts unrelated to the **K-Forge** club or **Fundación Universitaria Konrad Lorenz**.
